     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Holiday and leave",
     "texto": [
      "**Libur** is a day off or a holiday period. **Cuti** are days formally requested at work or school; they are not exactly interchangeable."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bookings",
     "texto": [
      "**Mengambil cuti** means to take days off. **Syarat pembatalan** are the conditions to check if you cancel a booking."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
